[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks through the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "美式。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "下午两点，一个中年男人走进来。\n苏念没见过他。灰色夹克，手里拎着一个公文包，包的拉链坏了一半，露出里面一沓文件的边角。\n\"美式。\"他坐到靠窗的位子上，把公文包放"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian carries a steaming cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你这店，开了多久了？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念做好端过去。男人接过杯子，喝了一大口。他的嘴唇干裂，像是很久没喝水。\n\"你这店，开了多久了？\"他问。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "六年。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"六年。\"苏念说，\"我外婆开了二十年。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen nods slowly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "男人点点头。他的目光扫过墙上的便签、吧台上的咖啡豆罐、天花板上那盏老式吊灯。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "好地方。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"好地方。\"他说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen sets the cup down on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "然后他放下杯子，从公文包里抽出一份文件，摊在桌上开始看。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian carries a steaming cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "lipstick mark",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "苏念回到吧台后面。男人的杯子还在冒热气，杯沿有一个模糊的唇印——他嘴唇干裂，唇印断断续续的。\n苏念端起杯子。\n不是为了读心。只是——"
  },
  {
