    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "scar on ring finger",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "[reading mind template]"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sets the cup down on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "多少钱？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Shock",
    "source_text": "苏念猛地睁开眼。\n杯子在她手里。咖啡凉了。她的手指攥着杯壁，指节发白。\n代价——她低头看手。手背上什么都没少。读心一个陌生人，代价几乎为零。\n但她的胃在翻搅。\n"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着他。他的脸上没有恶意，甚至有一点不好意思。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly the coffee",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你这咖啡不错。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你这咖啡不错。\"他说，\"以后可能喝不到了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian turns and leaves",
    "spoken_dialogue": "以后可能喝不到了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他走了。门关上。风铃没响——今天的风太大，风铃被吹歪了。\n苏念站在吧台后面，看着那张二十块钱。\n\"以后可能喝不到了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian clenches fists tightly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "老城区 街道办 拆迁公告",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "他知道。他刚才在文件里看到的——他知道这栋楼要拆。\n但他不知道苏念也知道。\n苏念把二十块钱收进抽屉。她的手还在发抖。她攥紧拳头，指甲陷进掌心。\n她需要确认。\n手"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the coffee",
    "spoken_dialogue": "念想咖啡店 产权",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "没有结果。\n她又输入\"念想咖啡店 产权\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen places down the phone",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "watercolor painting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "没有结果。\n她把手机放下。搜索引擎不会告诉她真相。但那个男人的心声——推土机、红字、木牌——那些画面太具体了，不像是假的。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the window",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "窗外，天阴了。乌云从西边压过来，把下午的光线吞掉了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks slowly the door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "营业中",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念走到门口，把\"营业中\"的牌子翻过来。背面是\"休息中\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Lin Ke"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Lin Ke",
    "action_visual": "Lin Ke locks the front door",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她锁上门。\n然后她走到墙边，看着那些便签。外婆写的便签、客人写的便签、林可画的小画。一面墙，满满当当的。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian reaches out to touch gently",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "她伸手摸了摸外婆那张便签。纸张发黄，字迹淡了一个笔画——\"念\"字的最后一笔。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "小念，如果你看到这行字，说明你已经忘了什么。别怕。有些东西不在脑子里，在杯子里。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "和昨晚一样。\n苏念的手指在便签上停了三秒。然后她把便签揭下来。\n便签背面，有一行很小的字。她从来没注意过。\n*\"小念，如果你看到这行字，说明你已经忘了什么。别怕"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stares intently",
    "spoken_dialogue": "如果你看到这行字，说明你已经忘了什么",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "handwriting",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念盯着那行字。\n外婆的字迹。她确定是外婆的字迹。但——\n\"如果你看到这行字，说明你已经忘了什么\"？"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "外婆知道？"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian draws latte art in the foam",
    "spoken_dialogue": "拉花不是技术，是心意",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念把便签翻过来，又翻回去。正面是\"拉花不是技术，是心意\"。背面是那行小字。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the sticky note",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "sticky note",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她把便签贴回墙上。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian carries a steaming cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "明天我来。带灯泡。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "窗外开始下雨了。雨点打在铁皮雨棚上，发出密集的噼啪声。\n苏念回到吧台后面，给自己泡了一杯咖啡。她端起杯子，看着杯壁上的倒影。\n倒影里，她看到了自己的脸。\n但她不"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at, motionless",
    "spoken_dialogue": "别来了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那行字。她的手指在屏幕上悬了很久。\n她打了一行字：\"别来了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands behind counter, breathing slowly, eyes cast down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "然后删掉。\n又打了一行：\"好。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 30,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sees something",
